"The IoT Box cannot detect the payment terminal. Please check if the terminal "
"is still connected."
msgstr ""
"IoT-boksi ei tunnista maksupäätettä. Tarkista, onko päätelaite yhä "
"yhdistettynä."

#. module: pos_iot
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/pos_iot/static/src/app/utils/printer/iot_printer.js:0
msgid ""
"The IoT Box is connected, but the receipt printer isn't. In order to "
"continue, ensure your printer is connected:\n"
"\n"
"1/ for USB printers, check the cable between the IoT Box and the receipt "
"printer\n"
"2/ for network printers, ensure the printer is connected to the internet."
msgstr ""
"IoT-boksi on yhdistetty, mutta kuittitulostin ei. Jatkaaksesi varmista, että "
"tulostin on yhdistetty:\n"
"\n"
"1/ USB-tulostin, tarkista IoT-boksin ja kuittitulostimen välinen kaapeli\n"
"2/ verkkotulostin, varmista tulostimen internet-yhteys."

